[CENTER][SIZE=6][B]Expressive Launcher 4.1.1 (Build 60) — Consistent Sizing, Sleek Folders & Pro Trial[/B][/SIZE]
[SIZE=4][I]Official Release Announcement & Download Links[/I][/SIZE][/CENTER]

[HR][/HR]

Three community-requested improvements delivered straight from our Telegram discussions. Thank you for the thoughtful feedback and bug reports!

[SIZE=5][B]✨ What's New & Improved[/B][/SIZE]

1. [B]7-Day Pro Free Trial[/B] (TG-008):
[LIST]
[*]You can now experience all Expressive Launcher Pro features free for 7 days with a single-device trial.
[*]Start the trial directly from the Expressive Pro screen to test all premium customisation and gesture features risk-free.

[/LIST]
2. [B]Stable Drawer Icon Sizing[/B] (TG-009):
[LIST]
[*]Fixed an issue where recycled app drawer views could experience icon size fluctuations when navigating in and out of the app list.
[*]Drawer views now strictly synchronize their layout metrics and icon bounds against the active [ICODE]AllAppsProfile[/ICODE] upon recycling and binding.

[/LIST]
3. [B]Compact Open Folder Padding[/B] (TG-010):
[LIST]
[*]Tightened vertical margins and footer padding inside open folder views (reducing excess whitespace at the top and around the folder footer).
[*]Folders look balanced and proportional across both 3-row and standard grid specs.

[/LIST]
[HR][/HR]

[SIZE=5][B]💬 Community Notes[/B][/SIZE]
[LIST]
[*][B]App Drawer Recycled Views[/B]: Thanks to Pratik for reporting the subtle icon size variation across drawer launches!
[*][B]Folder Geometry[/B]: Thanks to Adriano for highlighting the excess top/bottom padding in opened folders!

[/LIST]
[HR][/HR]

[SIZE=5][B]🧩 Release Riddle[/B][/SIZE]

I expand when you call me, hold all your favorites tight, yet shrink my empty edges so your screen feels just right. What am I?
[SPOILER="Click to reveal the answer"]A refreshed open folder with tightened padding! 📁✨[/SPOILER]

[HR][/HR]

